    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15709" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ē-mulgĕo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				lsum, 2, v. a., <i>to
				milk out.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exiguum lactis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 3, 17</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Poet.</b>, in gen., <i>to drain
			out</i>, <i>exhaust</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paludem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					68, 110</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">serum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 80,
					8</span></i>
			.</div>
